						},
						"description": "Uses the id saved by Create order (ids look like MDEV_ followed by 16 letters and digits, for example MDEV_7K3QX9M2PA4B8WDH; orders made before 19 Oct 2026 have 32 hex characters).\n\nWhile the order is AWAITING_PAYMENT or PARTIALLY_PAID, each call (at most once every 5 seconds per order) also asks Monnify whether it was paid, so the order moves on even if the webhook never arrives. When an order reaches SUCCESS and ZeptoMail is configured, the customer is emailed a receipt (to test it: pay the order in Monnify's bank simulator and set MAIL_SANDBOX=false, using your own email on the order)."
					}
				},
